        "Credential-only healthcheck maps to GET /v3/reference/tickers/types, the pinned validator and a cheap ticker-type directory, rather than aggregate bars.",
        "apiKey is sent as the documented query parameter on api.massive.com. api.polygon.io remains a parallel host and is not allowlisted here.",
        "HTTP 200 bodies with a populated error string are demoted via bodyErrorPaths [error].",
        "Native category is banking-data rather than Finance/Data: Rust CATEGORIES has no finance or data bucket.",
        "Returns raw Massive JSON under data rather than the upstream {meta,tickerTypes} wrapper. The upstream user-agent is not sent."
